# Plugin conventions

Clone an existing widget (`Nop.Plugin.Widgets.Jotform` or `Nop.Plugin.Widgets.Swiper`), do not invent a new project shape.

Required:
- `plugin.json` with `Group`, `SystemName`, `FileName`, `SupportedVersions: ["5.00"]`
- csproj `OutputPath` → `$(SolutionDir)\Presentation\Nop.Web\Plugins\{FolderName}`
- `NopTarget` after Build (see `Nop.Plugin.Widgets.Swiper/Notes.txt`)
- Views: Build Action Content, copy if newer

Widget plugins implement `IWidgetPlugin`: `GetWidgetZonesAsync`, `GetWidgetViewComponent`.
Payment plugins implement `IPaymentMethod`. Discount rules implement `IDiscountRequirementRule`.

Do not add a database migration for copy-only or settings-only plugins. Use `ISettingService`.
